WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Combustion bookkeeping. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Conserve atoms in an ideal equation

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: A balanced reaction conserves atoms in the chosen ideal equation. It does not describe every product or real combustion condition.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: 2 C₈H₁₈ + 25 O₂ → 16 CO₂ + 18 H₂O: both sides contain C16, H36 and O50.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Balance and explain

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Conserve atoms in an ideal equation
